{% if database_type != 'none' -%}
### Database

{% if database_type == 'supabase' and use_supabase_local -%}
This project uses [Supabase](https://supabase.com/) for the database.

#### Local Development

```bash
# Start local Supabase stack
just supabase-start

# Stop Supabase
just supabase-stop

# Open Supabase Studio
just db-studio

# View logs
just supabase-logs
```

Services:
- Studio: http://localhost:58172
- REST API: http://localhost:58167/rest/v1/
- Auth API: http://localhost:58167/auth/v1/
- Inbucket (Email): http://localhost:58170

{% elif database_type == 'postgresql' -%}
This project uses PostgreSQL for the database.

```bash
# Start database
just db-start

# Stop database
just db-stop

# Connect to database
just db-psql

{% if use_alembic -%}
# Run migrations
just migrate

# Create new migration
just migrate-new "description"

# Rollback migration
just migrate-down
{% endif %}
```

{% elif database_type == 'sqlite' -%}
This project uses SQLite for the database. The database file will be created automatically in the project directory.

