## Testing

```bash
# Run all tests
just test

# Run specific test file
just test-file tests/unit/test_example.py

# Run tests matching expression
just test-match "test_user"

# Run with coverage
just test-coverage

# Run only unit tests
just test-unit

# Run only integration tests
just test-integration
```

## Type Checking

This project uses [Pyright](https://github.com/microsoft/pyright) for static type checking with strict mode enabled.

```bash
just typecheck
```

## Code Quality

The project uses the following tools for code quality:

- **[Ruff](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff)**: Fast Python linter and formatter{% if ruff_strictness == 'strict' %} (strict mode){% elif ruff_strictness == 'recommended' %} (recommended rules){% endif %}

- **[Pyright](https://github.com/microsoft/pyright)**: Static type checker (strict mode)
- **[pytest](https://pytest.org/)**: Testing framework

```bash
# Run all quality checks
just check
```

## Claude Code Integration

This project includes [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) configuration for AI-assisted development.

### Available Commands

Slash commands (use in Claude Code chat):
- `/prime` - Prime Claude with project context
- `/git-commit` - Create a conventional commit
- `/run-all-tests` - Run all tests with coverage
- `/quality-check` - Run all quality checks

Custom agents:
- `test-runner` - Intelligent test execution and debugging
- `code-quality-check` - Fast type checking and linting

See `.claude/` directory for full configuration.

